  "an10.1:0.1": "",
  "an10.1:0.2": "",
  "an10.1:0.3": "",
  "an10.1:1.1": "Evam me sutaṃ. ",
  "an10.1:1.2": "Ekaṃ samayaṃ Bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati Jetavane Anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "an10.1:1.3": "Atha kho āyasmā Ānando yena Bhagavā ten' upasaṅkami, upasaṅkamitvā Bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdi. Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho āyasmā Ānando Bhagavantaṃ etad avoca ",
  "an10.1:2.1": "‘kimatthiyāni bhante kusalāni sīlāni kimānisaṃsānī' ti? ",
  "an10.1:2.2": "‘Avippaṭisāratthāni kho Ānanda kusalāni sīlāni avippaṭisārānisaṃsānī' ti. ",
  "an10.1:3.1": "‘Avippaṭisāro pana bhante kimatthiyo kimānisaṃso' ti? ",
  "an10.1:3.2": "‘Avippaṭisāro kho Ānanda pāmujjattho pāmujjānisaṃso' ti. ",
  "an10.1:4.1": "‘Pāmujjaṃ pana bhante kimatthiyaṃ kimānisaṃsan' ti? ",
  "an10.1:4.2": "‘Pāmujjaṃ kho Ānanda pītatthaṃ pītānisaṃsan' ti. ",
  "an10.1:5.1": "‘Pīti pana bhante kimatthiyā kimānisaṃsā' ti? ",
  "an10.1:5.2": "‘Pīti kho Ānanda passaddhatthā passaddhānisaṃsā' ti. ",
  "an10.1:6.1": "‘Passaddhi pana bhante kimatthiyā kimānisaṃsā' ti? ",
  "an10.1:6.2": "‘Passaddhi kho Ānanda sukhatthā sukhānisaṃsā' ti. ",
  "an10.1:7.1": "‘Sukhaṃ pana bhante kimatthiyaṃ kimānisaṃsan' ti? ",
  "an10.1:7.2": "‘Sukhaṃ kho Ānanda samādhatthaṃ samādhānisaṃsan' ti. ",
  "an10.1:8.1": "‘Samādhi pana bhante kimatthiyo kimānisaṃso' ti? ",
  "an10.1:8.2": "‘Samādhi kho Ānanda yathābhūtañāṇadassanattho yathābhūtañāṇadassanānisaṃso' ti. ",
  "an10.1:9.1": "‘Yathābhūtañāṇadassanaṃ pana bhante kimatthiyaṃ kimānisaṃsan' ti? ",
  "an10.1:9.2": "‘Yathābhūtañāṇadassanaṃ kho Ānanda nibbidāvirāgatthaṃ nibbidāvirāgānisaṃsan' ti. ",
  "an10.1:10.1": "Nibbidāvirāgo pana bhante kimatthiyo kimānisaṃso' ti? ",
  "an10.1:10.2": "‘Nibbidāvirāgo kho Ānanda vimuttiñāṇadassanattho vimuttiñāṇadassanānisaṃso' ti. 2. ",
  "an10.1:11.1": "Iti kho Ānanda kusalāni sīlāni avippaṭisāratthāni avippaṭisārānisaṃsāni, ",
  "an10.1:11.2": "avippaṭisāro pāmujjattho pāmujjānisaṃso, ",
  "an10.1:11.3": "pāmujjaṃ pītatthaṃ pītānisaṃsaṃ, ",
  "an10.1:11.4": "pīti passaddhatthā passaddhānisaṃsā, ",
  "an10.1:11.5": "passaddhi sukhatthā sukhānisaṃsā, ",
  "an10.1:11.6": "sukhaṃ samādhatthaṃ samādhānisaṃsaṃ, ",
  "an10.1:11.7": "samādhi yathābhūtañāṇadassanattho yathābhūtañāṇadassanānisaṃso, ",
  "an10.1:11.8": "yathābhūtañāṇadassanaṃ nibbidāvirāgatthaṃ nibbidāvirāgānisaṃsaṃ, ",
  "an10.1:11.9": "nibbidāvirāgo vimuttiñāṇadassanattho vimuttiñāṇadassanānisaṃso. ",
  "an10.1:11.10": "Iti kho Ānanda kusalāni sīlāni anupubbena aggāya parentī ",
  "an10.1:11.11": "ti. 1. "
}
